{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Hirzebruch--Riemann--Roch定理"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"title":[{"Plain":"“Hirzebruch–Riemann–Roch 定理”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>Hirzebruch–Riemann–Roch 定理是整体复 (代数) 几何中一个十分有用的定理. 它是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Riemann--Roch定理","text":"Riemann–Roch 定理"}},{"Plain":"的推广, 可视为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Grothendieck--Riemann--Roch定理","text":"Grothendieck–Riemann–Roch 定理"}},{"Plain":"中 $Y$ 为一个点且基域为 $\\mathbb{C}$ 的情形.</p>\n<p>对于紧复流形 (或概形) 上的"},{"Local":{"url":"全纯向量丛","text":"全纯向量丛"}},{"Plain":" (或一般的"},{"Local":{"url":"凝聚层","text":"凝聚层"}},{"Plain":"), 其 "},{"Local":{"url":"Euler示性数","text":"Euler 示性数"}},{"Plain":", 即"},{"Local":{"url":"凝聚层上同调","text":"凝聚层上同调"}},{"Plain":"的交错和 (对于平凡丛即 "},{"Local":{"url":"Dolbeault算子","text":"Dolbeault 上同调"}},{"Plain":"的"},{"Local":{"url":"指标","text":"解析指标"}},{"Plain":"), 等于 "},{"Local":{"url":"Todd类","text":"Todd 类"}},{"Plain":"与"},{"Local":{"url":"陈特征","text":"陈特征"}},{"Plain":"之积:\n$$\r\n\\chi(\\mathcal F) =\\int_M \\operatorname{ch}(\\mathcal F)\\wedge \\operatorname{td}(TM).\r\n$$\n(积分表示取最高维上同调)</p>\n<h2>曲线的情形</h2>\n<p>对于曲线 $X$ 上的除子 $D$,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"可逆层","text":"可逆层"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal O(D)$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"陈特征","text":"陈特征"}},{"Plain":"是 $1+c_1(\\mathcal O(D))$,</li>\n<li>曲线 $X$ 的 "},{"Local":{"url":"Todd类","text":"Todd 类"}},{"Plain":"是 $1+c_1(TX)/2$,</li>\n<li>$h^0(\\mathcal O(D))$ 就是 $l(D)$,</li>\n<li>$h^1(\\mathcal O(D))$ 由 "},{"Local":{"url":"Serre对偶","text":"Serre 对偶"}},{"Plain":"等于 $l(K-D)$, 其中 $K$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"典范除子","text":"典范除子"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}